From 997386990a9c08377c2cc6dde5140f350b1abffe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mawleesys <alsoalberdo@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 17:52:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Admin adjust UI, profile/admin transfers via queue, probe
 command, tests

Queue servers use a signed in-game adjust plus required reason instead of
set-balance. Site<->server transfers go through the operation queue when
enabledFor. Artisan currency:server-sync-probe enqueues 0-reconcile probes.
